  "schema:identifier": "id-249a1002c32e50199e27a502ef0ec3d8",
  "schema:name": "SMART Trust demo on the DPI-H Integrated View",
  "schema:description": "The two jurisdictions the demonstrator spans, Thailand (left) and Lao PDR (right), with what they share between them: WHO GDHCN and the WHO SMART Trust specifications. In each country its systems hold their parts, and each part says inside its box which DPI-H RA building block it plays («Provider Systems»): it realizes its own country’s instance of that block, a kind of the RA’s own, drawn in each journey’s view. The lines that run from one country to the other are where they meet: the paper DVC the family carries from J1 to J2 and J3, and the VHL QR and ITI-YY5 manifest fetch of J4.1, logged in Lao PDR.",
  "schema:image": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust-demo/archimate/0.1.0/views/id-249a1002c32e50199e27a502ef0ec3d8.svg",
